        "original_id": "f5e2e5e8-8349-52e9-b671-795831a98939",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: The Hunchback of Notre Dame (1996 film), Saludos Amigos, The Three Caballeros\n- People: Sakis Rouvas\n- Companies: Walt Disney Feature Animation, Walt Disney Pictures, Walt Disney Productions, Walt Disney, RKO Radio Pictures\n- Concepts: package films, Greek-language dubbing\n\nFacts:\n- Saludos Amigos is a 1942 American live-action animated package film produced by Walt Disney and released by RKO Radio Pictures.\n- The Three Caballeros is the second of the six package films released by Walt Disney Productions in the 1940s, following Saludos Amigos (1942).\n- The Hunchback of Notre Dame is a 1996 American animated musical drama film produced by Walt Disney Feature Animation for Walt Disney Pictures.\n- In 1996, Sakis Rouvas made his first cinematographic work by voicing Quasimodo in the Greek-language dubbing of Disney's The Hunchback of Notre Dame, titled I Panayia Ton Parision.",
